                                                                                
  Usage: bab queue [OPTIONS]                                                    
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Aliases: q                                                                    
                                                                                
  Options                                                                       
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  
       --all                             show everyone's jobs                   
       --user        TEXT                show jobs of USER                      
  -p   --partition   TEXT                filter by partition                    
  -w   --watch       [SECONDS] [x>=10]   refresh every SECONDS (default 10)     
                                         until Ctrl-C                           
  -h   --help                            Show this message and exit.            
                                                                                
                                                                                
